# Glassworks // Shattered Yard cast as its right door, Shattered Yard, in turn 1: "at the beginning of your end step, this
# Room deals 1 damage to each opponent" takes Bot2 from 20 to 19 at Bot1's end step, and it is dealt to the player only (the
# Llanowar Elves in play are not hurt) and not at Bot2's own end step. In turn 3 Bot1 unlocks Glassworks for {2}{R}, a
# special action (CR 709.5e), and "when you unlock this door" triggers (CR 709.5h): the Room deals 4 damage to Bot2's
# Baloth Prime. Fully unlocked, Shattered Yard's trigger fires again at Bot1's end step, 19 to 18.

